		(property "Description" "Dual Schmitt-trigger buffer for the encoder A/B lines. Powered from +3V3, so the STM32 never sees more than 3.3 V; inputs are 5.5 V tolerant with Ioff, so a live encoder cannot back-power or overstress anything before +3V3 is up."
